    "text": "Josh Scovens and Jaden Ellis\nJosh Scovens and Jaden Ellis\nCam Hayes\nEast Carolina Pirates\nGuard\nSenior\n6′3″ 188\nGreensboro Day School\nNext Game: vs. UTSA Roadrunners, Sunday, Feb. 23, 2 p.m.\nJaden Ellis\nArmy Black Knights\nGuard\nJunior\n6′0″ 166\nPage High School\nNext Game: vs. Bucknell Bison, Sunday, Feb. 23, 12 p.m.\nJosh Scovens\nArmy Black Knights\nForward\nSophomore\n6′6″ 214\nPage High School\nHometown: Greensboro\nNext Game: vs. Bucknell Bison, Sunday, Feb. 23, 12 p.m.\nWill Otto\nEmory Eagles\nGuard\nFreshman\n6′4″ 185\nGreensboro Day School\nHometown: Raleigh\nNext Game: vs. Washington Bears, Sunday, Feb. 23, 3 p.m.",
